 Um, well, I mean, obviously farming is authorship, right?

00:44:30.840 --> 00:44:36.330
 I mean, you know, farming is not, you know, is not just drudgery.

00:44:36.330 --> 00:44:43.650
 It's design and it's, it's articulating a really complex system or elaborating a really

00:44:43.650 --> 00:44:50.110
 complex system, um, on landscape based on, you know, opportunities and constraints and,

00:44:50.110 --> 00:44:56.730
 and sensibility and, and, and, you know, romance and practicality and all these things.

00:44:56.730 --> 00:45:04.870
 And so it's also, it happens, so happens that, um, farmers, you know, have plenty of quiet

