00:45:40.950 --> 00:45:45.330
 era and also weird, a lot of weird country life stuff going on in there.

00:45:45.330 --> 00:45:53.060
 But, you know, you had the vice president of the United States, um, uh, Henry Wallace,

00:45:54.250 --> 00:45:59.100
 you know, right, doing large scale experiments in revivifying the soil.

