 And, you know, run, and then there was an article about running, uh, you know, 4th of July

00:46:04.470 --> 00:46:14.080
 firecrackers through the, through the furrows of the land, you know, land worship as patriotism.

00:46:14.240 --> 00:46:19.000
 And I was like, my God, this is a heck of a lot more juicy than, you know, all this weird

00:46:19.000 --> 00:46:21.990
