 That's the point.

00:46:36.250 --> 00:46:44.940
 So that was, that's the mission is kind of historical remnants and, you know, some themes

00:46:44.940 --> 00:46:52.540
 get laid out and then people draw pictures and write stories and recent independent research,

00:46:52.540 --> 00:46:57.010
 um, you know, for, for each other, for ourselves.

